{title: A Brother to the Scum of the Earth}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Chorus:
D
We are the salt
G D
We are the light
D A D
We are the souls You have made right
D G D
With thankful hearts our praise we sing
Em D/F# G Asus --- A
To You, our Brother, Friend and King!

Verse 1:
A
You love us all
D
You know our name
A D
How can we ever be the same?
F#m Bm
Your grace and mercy all around
G Asus --- A
And what was lost has now been found.

Verse 2:
To all who hunger, You are Bread
And by Your life our souls are fed
To those who thirst, Your Waters flow
Your Word is all we need to know.

Verse 3:
Into our world You came by birth
A Brother to the scum of the earth
And for our lives You hung in pain
To pay the price, then rise again!
